13. OUTSOURCED VENDOR JOB ORDERS

One outsourced vendor job order may contain multiple items.

Each item must have its own:

- Item code.
- Quantity issued.
- Applicable rate.
- Returned quantity.
- QC-approved quantity.
- Rejected quantity.
- Outstanding quantity.
- Rework quantity.
