Production performance calculations

Use clearly defined formulas.

Production attainment:

Actual quantity trimmed ÷ Planned production quantity × 100.

First-pass quality rate:

Quantity accepted on first inspection ÷ Quantity inspected × 100.

Good-output efficiency:

Quantity accepted by QC ÷ Planned production quantity × 100.

Prevent division by zero and show not-applicable values appropriately.

Report rejected and reworked quantities separately.

Do not confuse financial cost per piece with expected production pieces per hour.

All reports must be exportable to Excel or CSV as appropriate.

